          · exact ⟨(1099/512), (4407/2048), (73/160), (147/320), rectangle_valid_388, hSl, hcut4, hcut2, hcut5⟩
          · exact ⟨(1099/512), (4407/2048), (147/320), (37/80), rectangle_valid_387, hSl, hcut4, hcut5, hcut0⟩
        · exact ⟨(4407/2048), (2209/1024), (73/160), (37/80), rectangle_valid_386, hcut4, hcut1, hcut2, hcut0⟩
    · rcases le_total m (73/160) with hcut6 | hcut6
      · rcases le_total S (4429/2048) with hcut7 | hcut7
        · exact ⟨(2209/1024), (4429/2048), (9/20), (73/160), rectangle_valid_385, hcut1, hcut7, hmL, hcut6⟩
        · exact ⟨(4429/2048), (555/256), (9/20), (73/160), rectangle_valid_384, hcut7, hSh, hmL, hcut6⟩
