      · rcases le_total S (4407/2048) with hcut13 | hcut13
        · rcases le_total m (151/320) with hcut14 | hcut14
          · exact ⟨(1099/512), (4407/2048), (15/32), (151/320), rectangle_valid_378, hSl, hcut13, hcut10, hcut14⟩
